Run it as your normal desktop user—not with sudo:

chmod +x CHRISTOPHER-FRESH-KUBUNTU.sh
./CHRISTOPHER-FRESH-KUBUNTU.sh

For a manual reboot:

./CHRISTOPHER-FRESH-KUBUNTU.sh --no-reboot

If NVIDIA remains unavailable after reboot, the installer stops safely and writes:

~/AI-PC/Logs/nvidia-diagnostic.txt

With Secure Boot enabled, complete the blue MOK enrollm
